---
// The stock the page is printed on: broad blotching from uneven paper, plus a
// finer directional fibre, both multiplied into the ink beneath.
//
// Fixed rather than absolute so the texture stays put while the page scrolls —
// paper does not slide under its own print. Purely decorative, so it never
// intercepts a pointer or reaches the accessibility tree.
//
// No edge darkening here, unlike the flyer: on a full-height page that reads as
// a vignette rather than a handled edge, and it was measurably eating contrast
// from body copy near the viewport edge.
---

<div class="pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 z-50" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="paper-mottle absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.13]"></div>
  <div class="paper-fibre absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.09]"></div>
</div>
